title: "margrecs_alginate: 3D cell population analysis of alginate-bead cultures"
abstract: >-
  Custom Python pipeline for three-dimensional multichannel confocal stacks of
  alginate-bead cultures acquired as Leica .lif containers. Images are loaded as
  (channel, Z, Y, X) arrays with anisotropy correction from Leica metadata;
  objects are segmented (Voronoi–Otsu or CellposeSAM), and morphological plus
  channel-wise intensity features are extracted with scikit-image for Ki67
  proliferation and A549/HPFa co-culture analyses.
license: BSD-3-Clause
